    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 155,
        "text": "(Music) ♫ She was preserved by modesty of the religion ♫ ♫ She was adorned by the light of the Quran ♫ Shereen El Feki: 4Shbab has been dubbed Islamic MTV.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "37543C5BFC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 132,
        "text": "Its creator, who is an Egyptian TV producer called Ahmed Abu Haïba, wants young people to be inspired by Islam to lead better lives.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "76DA0BB16F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 176,
        "text": "He reckons the best way to get that message across is to use the enormously popular medium of music videos. 4Shbab was set up as an alternative to existing Arab music channels.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C729F03E06",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "And they look something like this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD85AE97ED",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "(Music) That, by the way is Haifa Wehbe.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "DBBCA15AF0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "She's a Lebanese pop star and pan-Arab pin-up girl.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6D528F1763",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "In the world of 4Shbab, it's not about bump and grind.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D826680C4E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "But it's not about fire and brimstone either.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD6C14E189",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 34,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "kinder, gentler face of Islam",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
