      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "It's now a theme park.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "015834BA18",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "There is an animated series in the works.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "248DDB35CB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 145,
        "text": "And by this time next year, the likes of Superman and Wonder Woman will have joined forces with \"The 99\" to beat injustice wherever they find it.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2CD95615A7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "44",
        "end": "44",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "\"The 99\" and 4Shbab are just two of many examples of this sort of Islamic cross-cultural hybridization.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "276BF4EA7B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 53,
        "text": "clash of civilizations",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "488BE04506",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "We're not talking here about a clash of civilizations.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D7CFC46B51",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 23,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "indistinguishable mash",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "352DED31DB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "Nor is it some sort of indistinguishable mash.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8DEE6C276F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 27,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "mesh of civilizations",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "16DBE4FC27",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 63,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "strands of different cultures are intertwined",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6B57168482",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 109,
        "text": "I like to think of it as a mesh of civilizations, in which the strands of different cultures are intertwined.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "62BB6CF4E7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 103,
        "text": "Now, while 4Shbab and \"The 99\" may look new and shiny, there is actually a very long tradition of this.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "74759D4930",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 104,
        "text": "Throughout its history, Islam has borrowed and adapted from other civilizations both ancient and modern.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FD08F269EB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 20,
        "endOffset": 25,
        "text": "Quran",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "66A0110E4A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 67,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "870CE6063A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 137,
        "text": "After all, it's the Quran which encourages us to do this: \"We made you into nations and tribes so that you could learn from one another.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE96A6B6A3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "And to my mind, those are pretty wise words, no matter what your creed.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "123250BDDF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 60,
        "endOffset": 64,
        "text": "your",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE3E6DD8AC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3FC314A8C7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BDC3B320DF",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    }
  ]
}